ber**\n* **[Purchase](https://tickets.mirvish.com/secret/24738)** **your own ticket and select Friday November 6th at 7:30pm**, post your seat number and I will move you to going.\n\nA reminder will be sent the day before with my cell and reminder details where to meet and when.\n\nRSVPs close 1 day prior, and the Waitlist will be removed at that time. Cancellations will result in a No Show and impact future attendance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me for the Show at: 7:10pm inside the front doors of the CAA Theatre at 651 Yonge St. to the right side after scanning your tickets.**\n\n**Start: 7:30pm**\n\nLength: 1 hour 20 mins (no intermission)\n\nAfter: meet at the same spot to chat about the show and head out for our Dinner\n\nEnjoy and please post your comments in the Event after.","startDate":"2026-11-07T00:10:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-3-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"CAA Theatre","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Toronto","addressRegion":"ON","addressCountry":"ca","streetAddress":"651 Yonge St, Toronto, ON M4Y 1Z9, Canada, Toronto, ON"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Experience Toronto","url":"https://www.meetup.com/experiencetoronto/"},"performer":"Experience Toronto"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"DEMENTED EUCHRE $20.00","url":"https://www.meetup.com/ultimate-euchre/events/316687159/","description":"This isn't your grandma's euchre night.\nIt's **Big Bucks DEMENTED Euchre** — where strategy meets chaos, fortunes can change with a single card, and knowing when to go HIGH, go LOW, or unleash twists that could make all the difference.\n**Come for the euchre. Stay for the mayhem. Play to win the BIG BUCKS.** 💰🃏","startDate":"2026-11-07T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/imag